1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,629
Welcome to Melody and
Barnaby's Music Nuggets!

2
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:11,409
Today we are going to learn
about bars and barlines.

3
00:00:13,409 --> 00:00:17,564
Remember the beat?
Music has a steady beat.

4
00:00:20,064 --> 00:00:22,082
Let's count the beat.

5
00:00:22,586 --> 00:00:23,218
One.

6
00:00:23,268 --> 00:00:23,945
Two.

7
00:00:23,995 --> 00:00:24,725
Three.

8
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:25,536
Four.

9
00:00:25,586 --> 00:00:26,218
One.

10
00:00:26,268 --> 00:00:26,945
Two.

11
00:00:26,995 --> 00:00:27,725
Three.

12
00:00:27,775 --> 00:00:28,975
Four.

13
00:00:30,818 --> 00:00:34,369
We count to four,
and then start again.

14
00:00:37,169 --> 00:00:41,184
Let's draw a line
after every four beats.

15
00:00:41,684 --> 00:00:44,677
This is called a bar line.

16
00:00:47,277 --> 00:00:51,478
The space between two
bar lines is a bar.

17
00:00:54,478 --> 00:00:57,658
Bars are also called measures.

18
00:00:58,258 --> 00:01:03,155
Bar, or measure. They
mean the same thing.

19
00:01:05,955 --> 00:01:08,763
Every bar has four beats.

20
00:01:10,863 --> 00:01:14,553
Every measure has four beats too.

21
00:01:17,553 --> 00:01:21,290
Remember the stave? Five lines.

22
00:01:24,290 --> 00:01:27,980
At the start of the music,
there are two numbers.

23
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:31,798
They are called the time signature.

24
00:01:33,998 --> 00:01:38,385
The top number says
four beats in every bar.

25
00:01:38,885 --> 00:01:42,296
We will learn more about it later.

26
00:01:44,896 --> 00:01:46,543
Clap with me!

27
00:01:47,336 --> 00:01:47,968
One.

28
00:01:48,018 --> 00:01:48,695
Two.

29
00:01:48,745 --> 00:01:49,475
Three.

30
00:01:49,525 --> 00:01:50,286
Four.

31
00:01:50,336 --> 00:01:50,968
One.

32
00:01:51,018 --> 00:01:51,695
Two.

33
00:01:51,745 --> 00:01:52,475
Three.

34
00:01:52,525 --> 00:01:53,725
Four.

35
00:01:55,568 --> 00:01:58,561
Your turn! Look at the bars.

36
00:01:59,061 --> 00:02:02,008
How many beats in this bar?

37
00:02:06,308 --> 00:02:07,508
Four.

38
00:02:09,151 --> 00:02:11,263
Is this measure full?

39
00:02:15,363 --> 00:02:18,449
No! One beat is missing.

40
00:02:20,249 --> 00:02:22,964
How many bars, or measures?

41
00:02:27,064 --> 00:02:28,264
Three.

42
00:02:29,146 --> 00:02:30,468
You've got it!

43
00:02:32,168 --> 00:02:33,629
Now it's your turn!

44
00:02:33,729 --> 00:02:38,626
Play Fill the Bar, and
give every bar four beats!

45
00:02:38,726 --> 00:02:41,116
See you for the next Nugget!

